 "styleHint": "Slow, thick, sultry R&B trap with swung half-time drums, deep 808 sub, trunk-knock kick and swelling cinematic strings. Confident female lead with a Japanese-American accent — breathy whispered verses opening into effortless controlled belts, playful spoken ad-libs and giggle-cuts, English laced with Japanese phrases. Chopped-and-screwed tape-slow breakdown with pitch-bent vocal chops. Debut-single statement energy: cute on the surface, dangerous underneath, expensive throughout. Gold, night-time, luxurious.",
